@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Size-shortcut repair witness
+
+`reproduce.py` loads the retained 2.0.1 source and the repaired 2.0.2 source,
+labels fixed examples through the selected protected-Racket authority, and
+executes the rival “recolor every component of size at least 8.” It proves that
+the rival fits two old demonstrations and fails the repaired query.
+
+`sweep.py` performs a source-bound finite sweep of ordinary repaired draws and
+checks both `self_check` and the explicit size contrast. Reproduce from the
+library root:
+
+```bash
+python3 generators/b31e765ef780/counterexamples/review-f4bbc5c710b4b80e/reproduce.py
+python3 generators/b31e765ef780/counterexamples/review-f4bbc5c710b4b80e/sweep.py \
+  --seeds 128 --indices 8
+```
+
+The reports are reviewer evidence, not owner approval or training admission.
